    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring number 6 Castleview Green, Swords to the open market for sale. This lovingly maintained 2 bed, 1 bath terraced home offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. Ideally situated in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a small green space in one of Swords most sought-after residential areas, the property offers a peaceful setting while remaining conveniently located. Offered to the market with vacant possession and available for immediate occupation, the property presents a superb opportunity for those seeking a home in this popular North County Dublin location.\n\nThe ground floor is thoughtfully arranged to provide both practicality and generous living space. To the front, the bright kitchen/dining area offers a versatile space for everyday life and entertaining. To the rear, the spacious lounge is filled with natural light and features a charming fireplace, creating a warm and welcoming focal point. Useful additional storage adds to the functionality of the room, while sliding doors provide direct access to the rear garden, creating a seamless flow between the indoor and outdoor spaces.\n\nUpstairs, the central landing provides access to two generously proportioned double bedrooms. Both bedrooms benefit from built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage and making the most of the available space. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nOutside, the property continues to offer practical and attractive features. To the front, there is ample communal parking. To the rear, the private, low-maintenance garden features a small decking area and lawn, creating an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying time with family and friends, while keeping garden maintenance to a minimum.\n\nCastleview is ideally positioned in Swords, offering excellent access to the M1, M50, Dublin Airport and the wider Dublin region. The area is well served by public transport, with regular bus services providing convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. A host of amenities are within easy reach, including Tesco, local cafés and restaurants, Airside Retail Park, Pavilions Shopping Centre and Swords Village, offering an excellent choice of shopping, dining and leisure facilities. With a range of schools, parks and recreational amenities nearby, Castleview provides a well-established and convenient setting, appealing to first-time buyers, families and investors alike.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 1.11m (3'8\") x 4.45m (14'7\")\nWith laminate wood floor and doors to kitchen and lounge / diner.\n\nLounge - 3.96m (13'0\") x 5.24m (17'2\")\nWith laminate wood floor, sliding door to rear garden and door to under stairs storage.\n\nKitchen - 2.77m (9'1\") x 3.96m (13'0\")\nWith tiled floor, a range of matching base and eye level units, tiled splash backs, integrated fridge/freezer, integrated oven and hob and space and plumbing for washing machine.\n\nLanding\nWith carpet, doors to bedrooms 1, 2, bathroom and hot press. Hatched access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.96m (13'0\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nWith carpet and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.96m (13'0\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\nWith carpet and built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.8m (5'11\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\nWith tiled floors and partially tiled walls, a panel bath with overhead electric shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
